anes in O(1). Every vertex-space read hashes its vertex once; index-space reads and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"text":" algorithms hash none. Hyperedges can be appended but not removed. Equality","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignores the order of the vertices and of the hyperedges.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps from the vertices and the hyperedges to values can be attached (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyGraph"},{"text":"): a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex map is read by vertex index or by vertex, an edge map by hyperedge position.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencelist"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A directed hypergraph stored as an incidence list: each hyperedge’s sources and targets, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each vertex’s out- and in-hyperedges (its forward and backward stars), as two planes of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UndirectedIncidenceList","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s storage.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/PropertyGraph","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/Se","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SE","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SQ","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SH","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"m